{
  "$comment": "feat-018 BR-RT-5: (input, canonical[, editorOutput]) triples run by the server's and the panel's suites. Server: reduce(input) = canonical, reduce(editorOutput) = canonical, reduce(canonical) = canonical, where a result with no non-whitespace visible text is stored as the empty string (BR-RT-6). Panel: load canonical in the editor, serialise, normalise: canonical. Authored by the backend from US-2/US-7; the panel adds editorOutput columns and its own cases, both suites run the whole file.",
  "version": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "subset-kept",
      "story": "US-2",
      "note": "Formatting inside the subset is kept: headings, marks, nested lists, links, code, code block with a language, table.",
      "input": "<h3>Title</h3><h4>Sub</h4><p><strong>b</strong><em>i</em><u>u</u><s>s</s><code>c</code></p><ul><li><p>a</p><ol><li><p>b</p></li></ol></li></ul><pre><code class=\"language-sql\">select 1</code></pre><table><tbody><tr><th><p>h</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>d</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "canonical": "<h3>Title</h3><h4>Sub</h4><p><strong>b</strong><em>i</em><u>u</u><s>s</s><code>c</code></p><ul><li><p>a</p><ol><li><p>b</p></li></ol></li></ul><pre><code class=\"language-sql\">select 1</code></pre><table><tbody><tr><th><p>h</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>d</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
